Description: Wild OS status bars for Write and Tables
 The status bars as on the design boards. Write shows the page, the word
 and character count, the paragraph style at the cursor (a new field) and
 the language, packed on the left, and the zoom on the right. Tables shows
 the sheet, the language and the figures for the selection on the left,
 the sum first and set apart by space rather than semicolons, and the
 zoom on the right. In English the paragraph style field uses the style
 gallery's short names (Body text, Quote).
Author: Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>
Forwarded: not-needed

